WEBVTT

00:34:29.960 --> 00:34:33.495
So what I'm hearing is,
don't obsess about, like,

00:34:33.519 --> 00:34:37.856
understand introversion
and some of these associated things

00:34:37.880 --> 00:34:39.214
like shyness

00:34:39.238 --> 00:34:45.627
or spending time on the internal world
of thoughts and ideas and so forth,

00:34:45.651 --> 00:34:50.115
be aware of it, but don't obsess about it,
don't become a narcissist.

00:34:50.139 --> 00:34:53.331
The main thing to think about
is still what the external goals are.

00:34:53.355 --> 00:34:54.701
Let that be your North Star.

00:34:54.725 --> 00:34:56.022
SC: I mean, within balance.

00:34:56.046 --> 00:34:57.199
Let me flip it around.

00:34:57.223 --> 00:35:00.908
So, imagine you have somebody
who's very extroverted who loves science,